      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if there\u0027s some way to make this clear in the code. We don\u0027t want to someone to accidentally call `generate_ecdh_shared_secret` and use the result without applying a KDF. Maybe rename this function to `generate_ecdh_raw_shared_secret` and add doxygen about needing to use KDF on it before using it with a symmetric cipher?",
